  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently at the moment, many people who play VRChat don't have enough money to dish out for a VR headset, most users play on desktop. The stupid thing is desktop users can't use hands! There are probably countless ways the VRChat devs could implement hands into desktop mode. One example I will give is when I click a certain mouse button or key on the keyboard, it would raise one hand. A different key would raise a different hand and so on. I'm looking to but a VR headset but I don't have enough money at the moment, and I'm sure many other players don't either, so adding this would be amazing for desktop and laptop players alike. Thank you!",
